            "review_title": "Review at Reika",
            "review_text": "Shubin James\nSingapore, Singapore11 contributions\n0\nDinner while on vacation in Saigon\nMay 2024 • Friends\nUnforgettable memories created on vacation paired with unparalleled Yakitori dishes at this cozy Izakaya restaurant & bar. Loved the variety of the menu, the chef’s unique takes on dishes along with the cocktail pairings. Reika has undoubtedly set the mark. The hospitality we received from the Reika crew is second to none and our experience at Reika is definitely one for books. Highly recommend checking this place out.\nRead more\nWritten May 31, 2024",
