            "review_title": "Review at Reika",
            "review_text": "Chris\n11 contributions\n0\nHidden Gem of Japanese fusion cuisine in HCM city\nDec 2022 • Friends\nWhile on a girls’ trip to HCM city and despite all the readily available street food, we are glad we stopped by for a lovely and satisfying meal at Reika.\n\nReika had just opened 2 weeks ago, but the service standard and food quality was excellent, unlike many new establishments with early teething problems. The atmosphere was cosy, and a bar in the corner ensured we had our fair share of cocktails. We were told that the head bartender concocted her own drinks, hence not the usual run of the mill ones we often see at regular bars. \n\nFood was well-presented and fresh; not too salty or laden with seasonings. My favourites were the Octopus with kelp, freshly grilled yakitori sticks and Oyster with quail egg! Could’ve snacked all night on those while sipping on my Mojito. \n\nOwner Shaun and wife came by to check on us too and told us their story of how Reika Izakaya came to be. Thank you for the lovely evening!\nRead more\nWritten February 21, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
