            "review_title": "Review at Reika",
            "review_text": "Huy\n2 contributions\n1\nGREAT PLACE FOR HANGING OUT, DELICIOUS FOOD, FRIENDLY SERVICE\nDec 2022\nReika is an ideal choice for hanging out with friends, especially when you are craving for some real delicious yakitori. Even more than yakitori, Reika offers a wide choice of dishes, more like a fusion Japanese style restaurant. \nPersonally, I love the chicken meat balls, it's superb, and also the creamy crab spaghetti, yummyyyy!!! The dipping sauce is also very tasty.\nDefinitely gonna come back for more!!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 1, 2022",
