            "review_title": "Review at Reika",
            "review_text": "P&ZH\nWestern Canada285 contributions\n1\nGreat experience\nNov 2022 • Couples\nThis funky little place just opened with an interesting menu consisting of different varieties of skewers.\nWe tried the 5 assorted skewers along with something we’ve never tried, fried chicken skin, chicken tails and cartilage. \nVery eager friendly staff.\nWritten November 26, 2022\nShaun Ang\nThank you very much for trying us out! We appreciate your feedback and do hope you’ll try out other tasty dishes in future!\nWritten November 29, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
